# The ArchAstro concierge agent has no required env vars out of the box —
# its only custom tool (`fetch_archagents_docs`) hits public docs.
#
# Add values here only if you want to customize the agent for a
# specific agent network org. The identity prompt and skills do not
# read from the environment.

# Optional: identify which org context the concierge should prefer
# by default when the thread starts. The identity prompt does not use
# this directly; it is a convention for preinstalled deployments.
# AGENT_NETWORK_ORG=AcmeCo
